1795344277876	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-2654311952474234638"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:37.876-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:37.876-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer8"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"सुमेरको पतन"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"विलाप र भग्नावशेष: खडेरी, आक्रमण र फेरिँदो नदीधारले कसरी विश्वको पहिलो सभ्यतालाई अस्ताचलतिर पुर्‍यायो एकताका भव्य मन्दिरहरू र मानव इतिहासकै पहिलो लिपिका अक्षरहरूले धपधपी बलेका सुमेरका सहरहरू अन्ततः खडेरी, बाह्य आक्रमण र समयको भारीले थिचिएर ओइलाउँदै गए। तिनका भग्नावशेषमा आज पनि एउटा त्यस्तो जातिको प्रतिध्वनि अल्झिरहेकै छ—जसले हामीलाई सभ्यताको पहिलो बिहानी दियो, तर आफैँ भने त्यसको सबैभन्दा सुरुवाती "},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/2654311952474234638/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-patan-bilap-ra-bhagnawashesh.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2654311952474234638"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/2654311952474234638"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-patan-bilap-ra-bhagnawashesh.html","title":"सुमेरको पतन"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1vOYDByVida3VXbBSAVnbYhC5_e9uXEJq=s72-w1600-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}
1795344270179	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-5982285082367016740"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:30.179-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:30.179-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer7"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"सुमेरको पुनरुत्थान : अन्तिम स्वर्णयुग"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"हेल–बप धूमकेतुको अपशकुन र गुटी अन्धकार युगदेखि उर–नाम्मुका जिगुरात र उर्वर माटो निसास्स्याउने नुनसम्मको कथा। स.पू. २२१८ मा महान् अक्कडी सम्राट् नराम–सिनको मृत्यु हुँदा उनका छोरा शार–काली–शारीले केवल राजसिंहासन मात्र होइन, भित्रभित्रै कमजोर हुँदै गएको साम्राज्य पनि उत्तराधिकारमा पाए। उनको शासनको चौथो वर्ष मेसोपोटामियाको रात्रिकालीन आकाशमा एउटा अनौठो खगोलीय संकेत देखा पर्‍यो। झन्डै बीस करोड किलोमिटर"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/5982285082367016740/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-punarutthan-guti-andhakaryug-ra-nava-sumeriya-punarjagaran.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5982285082367016740"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5982285082367016740"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/sumerko-punarutthan-guti-andhakaryug-ra-nava-sumeriya-punarjagaran.html","title":"सुमेरको पुनरुत्थान : अन्तिम स्वर्णयुग"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1uDjKcvL-28dRMsNY5uZpixiMRiqvi6sR=s72-w1600-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}
1795344259928	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-7639493954993948679"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:19.928-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:44:19.928-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer6"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"अक्कडका सार्गन : पहिलो साम्राज्यको उदय"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"किशका एक पानसेवकले कसरी सुमेरको घमण्ड तोडे, मेसोपोटामियाको पहिलो साम्राज्य खडा गरे र तीन शताब्दी लामो खडेरीले त्यसलाई कसरी ढाल्यो। शताब्दीयौंसम्म मेसोपोटामियाको इतिहास दक्षिणका सुमेरियाली नगर–राज्यहरूको हातमा रह्यो—स्वाभिमानी, स्वतन्त्र र नहर, सिमाना अनि प्रतिष्ठाका लागि निरन्तर आपसमा जुधिरहने नगरहरू। तर सुमेरियाली महत्वाकांक्षा चरममा पुगेको बेला पनि, जब विजेता लुगल–जागे–सी (Lugal-zage-si) ले फारस"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/7639493954993948679/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/akkadka-sargon-pahilo-samrajyako-udaya.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7639493954993948679"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/7639493954993948679"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/akkadka-sargon-pahilo-samrajyako-udaya.html","title":"अक्कडका सार्गन : पहिलो साम्राज्यको उदय"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"https://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif"}}],"media$thumbnail":{"xmlns$media":"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/","url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1aM3G5BR0PeDQ7KOohS193QZTiqc4fDa0=s72-w1600-c","height":"72","width":"72"},"thr$total":{"$t":"0"}}
1795344238139	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-4479717553355470809"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:58.139-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:58.140-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer3"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"उरुक सहर: मानव सभ्यताको पहिलो महानगर"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"त्यो पहिलो महानगर, जहाँ मानिसले आफ्ना सुरुवाती अक्षरहरू भेटे दक्षिणी मेसोपोटामियाको माटोको फाँटबाट उठेको उरुक मानव इतिहासकै पहिलो विशाल महानगर बन्यो। “जसले अथाह गहिराइ देखे, भूमिको जग चिने, जो सबै बाटाका ज्ञाता थिए, हर कुरामा विवेकी थिए।” यिनै पङ्क्तिबाट सुरु हुन्छ द एपिक अफ गिलगामेश (The Epic of Gilgamesh) — राजसत्ता, शोक, अमरत्वको खोज र एकपटक सिङ्गो संसार निल्ने महाप्रलयको कथा। स.पू. २८०० तिर रच"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/4479717553355470809/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/uruk-sahar-manav-sabhyatako-pahilo-mahanagar-ra-akshar.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4479717553355470809"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/4479717553355470809"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/uruk-sahar-manav-sabhyatako-pahilo-mahanagar-ra-akshar.html","title":"उरुक सहर: मानव सभ्यताको पहिलो महानगर"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.co