1795344228002	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-8961990465162521723"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:48.002-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:48.003-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer5"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"उर र लगश: व्यापार र युद्धको नयाँ युग"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"व्यापार र युद्धको नयाँ युग ई.सं. १६१४ मा पिएत्रो देल्ला भाले (Pietro Della Valle) नामका एक इटालियन कुलीन व्यक्ति भेनिसबाट निस्केर कन्स्टान्टिनोपलतर्फ समुद्री यात्रामा निस्किए। टर्की, इजिप्ट र सिरिया हुँदै उनको यात्रा सन् १६१६ को अक्टोबरमा इराक पुग्यो। बगदादमा उनको प्रेम अस्सिरियाली इसाई कुलीन युवती सित्ती मानी (Sitti Maani) सँग बस्यो, र केही महिनाभित्रै दुवैको विवाह भयो। सन् १६१७ को सुरुवाततिर आफ्"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/8961990465162521723/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/ur-ra-lagash-vyapar-ra-yuddhako-naya-yug.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8961990465162521723"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/8961990465162521723"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/ur-ra-lagash-vyapar-ra-yuddhako-naya-yug.html","title":"उर र लगश: व्यापार र युद्धको नयाँ युग"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":