1795344220239	{"id":{"$t":"tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-8657703664257880060.post-5906961788664805797"},"published":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:40.239-05:00"},"updated":{"$t":"2026-11-22T05:43:40.240-05:00"},"category":[{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Articles"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"History"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"lang-ne"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"Nepali"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"pair-sumer2"},{"scheme":"http://www.blogger.com/atom/ns#","term":"series-sumer"}],"title":{"type":"text","$t":"बाढीदेखि खेतसम्म"},"summary":{"type":"text","$t":"एरिदुले कसरी मरुभूमिलाई मानव सभ्यतामा बदल्यो सुरुवातमा एउटा महाबाढी आएको थियो। एरिदु कुनै विजय वा आक्रमणको जगमा होइन, बाँच्ने सङ्घर्षको जगमा उभिएको थियो। बाढीपछिको समयमा मानिसहरूले नहर र माटोको सहारामा मरुभूमिको रूप नै बदलिदिए—अभावलाई भण्डारणमा र बाढीमैदानलाई लहलहाउँदो खेतमा रूपान्तरण गरे। दक्षिणी मेसोपोटामिया (Mesopotamia) को यही भूमिमा 'सभ्यता' भन्ने विचारले पहिलो पटक जरा गाडेको थियो। छोटकरीमा ह"},"link":[{"rel":"replies","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/feeds/5906961788664805797/comments/default","title":"Post Comments"},{"rel":"replies","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/badhidekhi-khetsamma-eridu-pahilo-sahar-sumer.html#comment-form","title":"0 Comments"},{"rel":"edit","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5906961788664805797"},{"rel":"self","type":"application/atom+xml","href":"https://www.blogger.com/feeds/8657703664257880060/posts/default/5906961788664805797"},{"rel":"alternate","type":"text/html","href":"https://www.kafka.blog/2026/11/badhidekhi-khetsamma-eridu-pahilo-sahar-sumer.html","title":"बाढीदेखि खेतसम्म"}],"author":[{"name":{"$t":"Unknown"},"email":{"$t":"noreply@blogger.com"},"gd$image":{"rel":"http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail","width":"16","height":"16","src":"http